WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,500
The old man died violently at the gate of Yingxiu Mountain

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,020
If you can't get out of that circle, you are the gatekeeper.

3
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:15,950
I haven't talked to anyone in a long time. I'm making trouble with a low horse. You see, you take it seriously.

4
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:19,150
My name is Ye Baocai. I was also a disciple during my lifetime.

5
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:22,350
I have so many secrets to thank, I know that my big gift is coming soon

6
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:26,550
So I went to Yingxiu Mountain to seek help for calamity. As soon as I arrived at the door, I was hit and killed by a drunk driver.

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:30,620
My soul is trapped there. Didn't you meet me first to be freed?

8
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:35,020
Dare I ask what skills you have?

9
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:39,420
I'm good at massage and fortune telling, fortune telling and feng shui scare the kid.

10
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:48,020
Please come to the camp, sir.

11
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:54,500
Xiaotie, please come with me to see my daughter.

12
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,100
Aunt Yang, please speak clearly. What does it mean to be crazy?

13
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,700
If you don't tell me clearly, how can I go?

14
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:01,300
She is standing in the middle of my yard now

15
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:05,430
With a kitchen knife in your hand, who are you looking at?

16
00:01:05,430 --> 00:01:09,060
Xiaotie, can you come with me and see if you can?
